# WhaleFalls Casus

**WhaleFalls Casus** is a mobile hiking-trail companion app for discovering, saving,
and downloading trails in Cape Town and the Western Cape. It was built as the final 
group project for the **Diploma in Software Development (OPSC6321 – Part 3, Final Submission)
** at Rosebank College (IIE).

